VulkanPCloud (pc::)

Point-cloud GI, point-light BRDF and BVH shadows, a 3D probe grid,
spatial candidate indexing, tiled light selection, tonemapping and
presentation. Host supplies its G-buffer and an existing VulkanWrapper.
Public API: pcloud/pcloud.hpp; shaders: pcloud/shaders/.
Build locally with pcloud/build.c or link its source in your renderer.
